      <title>Reform £72 Million Donation: Crypto Billionaires Love Farage for a Reason</title>
      <link>https://www.bloomberg.com/opinion/articles/2026-09-16/reform-72-million-donation-crypto-billionaires-love-farage-for-a-reason</link>
      <guid isPermaLink="false">398e2b99b8cbe9288a6bb004</guid>
      <pubDate>Wed, 16 Sep 2026 04:00:02 +0000</pubDate>
      <description>The record-breaking £72 million ($97 million) of donations to Reform UK — given by two crypto billionaires who until recently were based overseas — will, as the party contends, help it prepare for government, providing resources to hire policy specialists, expand and professionalize its operations and build a nationwide electoral machine. What they may not do is dispel the atmosphere of sleaze and rule-bending that threatens the success of Nigel Farage’s populist project.</description>
